+## Error and cleanup guarantees
+
+- A `beforeSession` hook that throws still reaches the caller as a rejection, unchanged from the original error ([validated by: reaches the caller as a rejection when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/beforeSession-error.acceptance.test.ts#L24)).
+- `onError` fires when `beforeSession` throws, receiving the same session and error as any other orchestrator failure ([validated by: fires onError when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/beforeSession-error.acceptance.test.ts#L37)).
+- `afterSession` fires when `beforeSession` throws, allowing cleanup even if the session failed to start ([validated by: fires afterSession when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/beforeSession-error.acceptance.test.ts#L62)).
+
